IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-BITNET-PLUS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 ROWS-R              PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 COLS-C              PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PARAMS-COUNT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-BITNET-PLUS.
    IF ROWS-R == 0 OR COLS-C == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE ROWS-R TO PARAMS-COUNT.
    MULTIPLY COLS-C BY PARAMS-COUNT.
    MOVE 6800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PARAMS-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
